Route A slope-variance parameter is theta_dep_chol (per
tests/testthat/test-phylo-indep-slope-gaussian.R: phylo_indep desugars to
phylo_slope's block-diagonal Cholesky engine, NOT theta_diag_B_slope /
theta_rr_B_slope). theta_dep_chol packs, per trait, 2 diagonal Cholesky
entries (log-scale int SD, log-scale slope SD) + 1 within-block
off-diagonal -- 3 * n_traits entries total. The SLOPE variance for trait t
is entry 2 of that trait's 3-entry block (index 3*(t-1)+2), on a LOG scale.

